From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: finalpantasy <finalpantasy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:21:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/34] Build the runtime natively on Windows hosts (MinGW-w64
 UCRT clang)

- platform_win.cpp: VirtualAlloc-backed VM, fibers for stacks and
  coroutines, QPC time, binary file mode by default; platform.h gains
  a portable VM interface used by guest_memory, lazy_mem, write_watch.
- dispatch.cpp: vectored exception handler for guest faults; guest
  exceptions rethrow through RedirectToCall.
- Win32 HLE: host_compat.h for POSIX time/file calls, real
  d3d11/dxgi with the SDL window's HWND, GetAdaptersAddresses for
  the adapter list.
- CMake: static libraries linked whole-archive on Windows,
  _FILE_OFFSET_BITS=64 under MinGW, processor fallback for MSYS2
  shells, roundeven shim for CORE-MATH.
- tests: memory tests link the host platform file.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
